<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MAL" style="id">Malakia</book>
  <para style="h">Malakia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malakia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malakia</para>
  <para style="mt">Malakia</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel-te chungchânga Lalpa thuchhuak Malakia ziak chu
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Ka hmangaih che u a ni,” a ti a. Nangni erawh chuan, “Engah khân nge min hmangaih?” in ti a. Esauva leh Jakoba chu unau an ni a, Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Jakoba chu ka hmangaih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Esauva chu ka ngaina lo, A tlângte pawh ram rovah ka siam a, A rochan ram pawh thlalêr sihalte ka pe ta.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Edom mite chuan, “Min lo tichhe tawh mah se, Kan khawpui hluite chu kan din thar leh mai ang,” an ti a. Mahse, Lalpa , Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Din mah se, ka tichhe leh tho vang, ‘Suahsualna ram, kumkhaw Pathian ânchhe dawngho,’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In mit ngeiin in hmu ang a, Lalpa chu Israel ram pâwnah pawh, ‘A va lo ropui êm!’ in ti ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Fapain a pa a chawimawi a, chhiahhlawhin a pu, Kei hi in pa ka ni a, engati nge min chawimawi loh? Kei hi in pu ka ni a, engati nge min ṭih loh?” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti. “Puithiamte u, nangni hi in ni mi hmusittute chu.” ‘Engah khân nge kan hmuhsit che?’ in ti a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Ka maichâma chaw bawlhhlawh in hlanah hian.’ ‘Engtin nge kan tihbawlhhlawh che?’ in ti a. ‘ Lalpa maichâm hi a lo nêp mang e,’ in tihah hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ran mitdel inthawinaa hlan hi a dik maw? Ran kebai leh a silawng hlan pawh a dik maw? In ram rorêltu pe dâwn teh u, in chungah a lâwm ang maw? A hlim hmêl in hmu ang maw?” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tûnah, Pathian chu, min khawngaih tûrin ngên chiam teh u, Chutiang thil in hlan avângin A lo ngaihsak dâwn che u em ni?” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ka maichâm mei in tihalh hi a sâwt lo, In zînga pakhat hian ka Tempul kawngka khâr law law se a ṭha zâwk tûr! In chungah ka lâwm lo, in thilhlan pawh ka pawm dâwn lo,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ni chhuahna lam aṭanga a tlâkna lam thlengin, Hnam tin zîngah ka hming a ropui ta a ni. Hnam tinin ka hmingin rimtui an hâl ang a, Inthawina pawh an hlân ang, Hnamte zîngah ka hming a ropui ta si a,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“ ‘ Lalpa maichâm chu a lo nêp mang e, Chuta ei tûr an hlante pawh chu a zahpuiawm.’ In tih hian ka maichâm in tibawlhhlawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />‘A va ninawm êm!’ tiin hnâr in tum khum ta si a,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti. “Inthawina atân mi thil in lâksak, Ran kebai te, a silawng te ka lo pawmsak ang che u maw?” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ran hmêlhem lo Lalpa hnêna hlan in tiam a, A patuai ṭha tak nei reng bawk sia, A hmêlhem hlântu chuan ânchhia dawng rawh se, Lal ropui tak ka ni a, hnam tinin ka hming hi an ṭih a ni,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khai le, puithiamte u, Ka thupêk hi in tân a ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ka thu in ngaihthlâk lohva, Tihtakzeta ka hming in chawimawi loh chuan, In chungah ânchhia ka thlentîr ang a, In chanvote pawh ânchhia ka lawh ang, A ni, tihtakzeta min chawimawi loh avângin, Chûng chu ânchhia ka lawh dêr tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai teh u, nangmahni avângin in thlahte ka hrem dâwn, In hmaiah in inthawina ran êk ka tât ang a, Êk kai luai chung chuan an paih ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Levia hnêna ka thuthlung a ngheh zêl theih nân, He thupêk hi ka pe che u a ni tih in hria ang,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An hnêna ka thuthlung chu nunna leh thlamuanna tûr a ni a, Min ṭih theih nân chu chu an hnênah ka pe a, Min ṭih ta ngei reng a, Ka hming pawh an pawisa ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mite thu dik a zirtîr a, dâwt a sawi ngai lo, Ka hmaah ngaihngam tak leh dik takin a khawsa a, Thil sual ti lo tûrin mi tam tak a pui ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Puithiamte chu thu dik kawltu an ni a, Miten an thu zirtîr an ngaichâng tûr a ni, Engkim Lalpa thuchah kengtute an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangni erawh chuan kawng dik in pênsan a, In zirtîrna chuan mi tam tak a titlu a, Levia hnêna thuthlung in bawhchhe ta,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tu man ka thu in zâwm lo va, Hleih nei taka ro in rêl avângin, Kei pawhin mi tin endawng leh Hmuhsitah ka siam che u a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan vaiin pa pakhat thlah kan ni lo vem ni? Pathian pakhat siam vek kan ni lâwm ni? Kan pate thuthlung bawhchhiain Engah nge kan inphatsan ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Juda chuan bum a chîng a, Israel ramah leh Jerusalem-ah thil tenawm a ti ta, Nupuiah pathian dang bia a neih avângin Ram thianghlim, Lalpa thlâkhlelh chu A tibawrhbâng ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa hnêna thil hlan rawn keng mah se, Chûng thil titu tawh phawt chu Jakoba puan in ata Lalpa chuan a paih chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In inthawina chu a lâwm lo va, a pawm hek loh avângin Hêng thil hi in ti bawk: In ṭap a, in chiau vawng vawng a, Lalpa maichâm chu in mittuiin a far huh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangnin, ‘Eng vângin nge a pawm loh?’ in ti maw? Lalpa hriatah i tawn tirh nupui chu Rinawm taka neiin kawppui tlat i tiam a. I thutiam chu i bawhchhiat tâk avâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathianin i nupui nên chuan Tisa leh thlarau pumkhata Awm tûrin a siam che u a ni lâwm ni? ‘Eng atân maw?’ ‘Pathian mi, fa ṭha tak tak hring tûrin’ a ni. Chuvângin, i tawn tirh nupui nêna in thuthlung chu Bawhchhe lo tûrin fîmkhur rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Inmâk hi ka haw takmeuh va, Nupuite râwng taka sawisak pawh ka hua a ni,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti. “Chuvângin, in nun vêng ṭha ula, rinawm takin awm rawh u.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In thu sawiin Lalpa a tihah ta, Nangnin, ‘Engtin nge kan tihhah?’ in ti a. ‘Thil sual titute chu Lalpa mit hmuhah mi ṭha an ni a, An chungah pawh a lâwm hle a ni,’ in ti a, ‘Khaw nge dik taka rorêl ṭhîn Pathian chu a awm,’ In tihahte hian.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ngai teh, ka tirhkoh ka rawn tîr dâwn, Ani chuan ka hmaah kawng min buatsaihsak ang. In zawn Lalpa chu a Tempul-ah a lo lang thut ang a, Hmuh in nghahhlelh êm êm Thuthlung tirhkoh pawh a lo kal ang,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mahse, a lo kal ni chu tu nge dâwl zo vang? A lo lang chu tu nge tuar zo vang? Ani chu rawhtuina mei anga sa leh Puansutu sahbawn anga chak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tangkarua rawhtuia tithianghlimtu ang a ni ang a, Levia fate chu rangkachak leh tangkarua angin A tithianghlim ang a, Tichuan, Lalpa hnênah inthawina dik tak an hlân ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hun kal ta, hmasâng nite ang khân, Judai ram leh Jerusalem mite thil hlan chu Lalpa chuan a lo lâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rorêl tûrin ka lo kal thuai dâwn, Dawithiam te, uire te, dâwta chhechham te, Hlawhfa hlawh pe ṭha duh lo te, Hmeithai te, fahrah te, hnam dang te hnehchhiaha, Min phatsantute chu thiam loh ka chantîr nghâl ang,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Kei Lalpa hi ka danglam ngai lo va, Chuvângin, nangni Jakoba thlahte u, In la ral rih lo a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangni erawh chuan in pi leh pute aṭang tawh khân, Ka thuruat in hawisan a, in zâwm hek lo. Ka lam lo hawi ula, kei pawh in lam ka lo hawi ang,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti. “Nangni erawh chuan, ‘Engtin nge i lam kan hawi ang?’ in ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Miin Pathian chanpual a rûksak tûr em ni? Nangni erawh chuan min rûksak si a. ‘Engah hian nge kan rûksak che?’ in ti a. ‘Sâwma pakhat leh thilhlanahte hian!’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka chanpual min rûksak avângin in hnam pum pui chu ânchhia lawh a ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sâwma pakhat dik tak thawhlâwm bâwmah rawn dah ula, Tichuan, ka inah ei tûr a awm dâwn nia. He thilah hian mi han fiah teh rêng u, Vân tukverhte chu ka hawnsak ang che u a, Malsâwmna dawn sên loh ka vûr ang che u,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tichhetu ka vêng ang a, In lova thlaite chu a tichhe tawh lo vang. In huana grepte pawh a hlamtla tawh lo vang,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hnam tinrêngin nihlawh an ti ang che u a, Hlim takin in ramah ngei in awm tawh ang,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ṭawng chhe tak takin mi sawichhe ṭhîn,” Lalpa chuan a ti. “ ‘Engtin nge kan sawichhiat che?’ in ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />‘Pathian rawngbâwl hi thil sâwt lo tak a ni a, Engkim Lalpa duhzâwng tih leh A hmaa lungchhe taka inlante hi, Eng nge a hlâwkna?’ in tihah hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />‘Mi chapote an nihlawh a, Thil sual titute an lian tual tual a, Pathian dawhtheihzia fiahtute hrem lohvin an chhuak a,’ In ti ṭhîn.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa ṭihtute chu an inbia a, Lalpa chuan a lo ngaithla a, a hre ta a, Lalpa ṭiha a hming ngaisângtute hming chu, Hriatrengna lehkhabu-ah, a hmuh ngeiah ziak a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Ka hun ruat tharah chuan anni chu Ka chanpual an ni ang a,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti. “Miin a fa, amah châwmtu tûr a duat angin, Ani chu ka duat ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, mi dik leh mi sual danglamna te, Pathian rawngbâwltu leh rawngbâwl lotu te. An chan tûr a danglamna an thliar thei ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ngai teh, thuk alh hluah hluah ang ni chu a lo thleng dâwn, Mi chapote leh thil sualtitu zawng zawng chu Buhpâwl ang an ni ang a, Chumi ni-ah chuan an kâng ral vek ang a, A zung leh a zâr pawh a zuah lo vang,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nangni ka hming ṭihtute tân felna ni a lo chhuak ang, A zung chu damna a ni ang a, Bâwngnote chhuah angin hlim takin in zuang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hêng thil hi ka tih ni chuan, Mi sualte chu in rapbet ang a, In kephah hnuaia vaivut ang mai an ni ang,” Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka chhiahhlawh Mosia hnêna dân ka pêk te, Horeb tlânga Israel mi zawng zawng tâna Dân leh thuruat ka pêkte kha hre reng rawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai teh u, Lalpa ni ropui râpthlâk thlen hmain In hnênah zâwlnei Elija ka rawn tîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani chuan pate leh an fate a inremtîr ang, Chutilo zawng, ka lo kal ang a, Ram chu ka nghaisa ang a, Ka tichhe vek mai ang.”
  </para>
</usx>
